"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/multi-product-"
"formula/extracted-outputs/87d2ac0c-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's return to the calculation of the expectation value for a single time "
"point. We'll pick a backend for executing the experiment on hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bumalik tayo sa pagkalkula ng expectation value para sa isang solong time "
"point. Pipili tayo ng backend para isagawa ang eksperimento sa hardware.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then we remove outlier qubits from the coupling map to ensure that the "
"layout stage of the transpiler doesn't include them. Below we use the "
"reported backend properties stored in the `target` object and remove qubits "
"that either have measurement error or a two-qubit gate above a certain "
"threshold (`max_meas_err`, `max_twoq_err`) or $T_2$ time (which determines "
"the loss of coherence) below a certain threshold (`min_t2`).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ay tinatanggal natin ang mga outlier qubit mula sa coupling map "
"upang matiyak na hindi isasama ng transpiler sa layout stage ang mga ito. Sa"
" ibaba, ginagamit natin ang iniulat na mga katangian ng backend na nakaimbak"
" sa `target` na object at tinatanggal ang mga qubit na may measurement error"
" o two-qubit gate na lampas sa isang tiyak na threshold (`max_meas_err`, "
"`max_twoq_err`) o may $T_2$ time (na nagtatakda ng pagkawala ng coherence) "
"na mas mababa sa isang tiyak na threshold (`min_t2`).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We want to set `max_meas_err`,  `min_t2`, and `max_twoq_err` such that we "
"find a large enough subset of qubits that supports the circuit to run. In "
"our case it's enough to find a 10-qubit 1D chain.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nais nating itakda ang `max_meas_err`,  `min_t2`, at `max_twoq_err` upang "
"mahanap ang sapat na malaking subset ng mga qubit na sumusuporta sa circuit "
